{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"jj-feild","name":"JJ Feild","birthDate":"1978-04-01","birthPlace":"Boulder, Colorado, USA","bio":"John Joseph Feild (born 1978), better known as JJ Feild, is a British American film, television, and theatre actor. He started his television career in 1999. Feild played Fred Garland in Philip Pullman's The Ruby in the Smoke and The Shadow in the North television adaptations. In 2007, he starred as Henry Tilney in the television film Northanger Abbey. The following year, he made his West End debut in a production of Ring Round the Moon. From 2014 to 2016, Feild portrayed Major John André in Turn: Washington's Spies. Feild's film credits include Telstar (2009), Captain America: The First Avenger (2011), Austenland (2013), and Professor Marston and the Wonder Women (2017).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:34:05+00:00","tmdbId":30710,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/30710","credits":[{"id":"cap-first","title":"Captain America: The First Avenger","character":"James Montgomery Falsworth","characterFa":"جیمز مونتگومری فالسورث"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/jj-feild.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Tom Clancy's Jack Ryan: Ghost War","year":2026,"character":"Andrew Spear","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8ehYxUh5MWE41AeE9gkHE8DKzvB.jpg"},{"name":"Prisoners of Paradise","year":2025,"character":"Harry","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d11G12RZ0gkoQIzrIwpqmLiGQDk.jpg"},{"name":"Little Disasters","year":2025,"character":"Ed","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aQJZBIEWw91O9MbpUOBRcd5JvJl.jpg"},{"name":"The Peripheral","year":2022,"character":"Lev Zubov","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2e5NNQu9B1fXBNllRj8fzysCguP.jpg"},{"name":"Ford v Ferrari","year":2019,"character":"Roy Lunn","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dR1Ju50iudrOh3YgfwkAU1g2HZe.jpg"},{"name":"Turn Up Charlie","year":2019,"charact